# type(scope): short description
#
# types : feat bug test doc refactor build ci chore
# scopes: boot arch cpu mm proc sched syscall fs vfs drivers serial lib log
#         panic user abi toolchain build test docs ci repo
#
# Rules: scope required; lowercase imperative description; no trailing period;
#        header <= 72 characters. One commit = one coherent logical change.
#
# Body (optional, after a blank line): why the change is needed and how it was
# verified (commands run, or "not run: reason").
